        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="7" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="4. The system finds the coordinates through the geocoding service (Nominatim, called through the gateway) and places a pin." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="105" width="220" x="-110" y="500" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="8" parent="1" style="rhombus;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;shapeInside=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="5. The Contributor enters the name, place type, description, adds photos (with captions) and recorded audio if any. E3, E4." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="145" width="320" x="-160" y="665" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="9" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="6. The system (Media) checks and stores the files and returns their URLs." vertex="1">
