        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="12" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="9. The system saves the place at the end of the list; a place with recorded audio is &quot;human voice&quot;, the rest are read with the device's voice." vertex="1">
