        <mxCell id="13" parent="1" style="rhombus;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;shapeInside=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="10. With moderation enabled, the system sends the place to Moderation (place.submitted event) so AI checks the text and photos. E5." vertex="1">
